{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["The reason for <b>and to give them provision for the way</b> is so that they would not eat on the road what they had purchased. Now, he let them know this because he placed the provision in their hands by way of kindness, so that they would be able to bring the brother, for he said: I have no intention to do you harm, if your words prove trustworthy."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:44:00.867798199Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}